---
import ResearchFigureFrame from './ResearchFigureFrame.astro';
---

<ResearchFigureFrame
  className="composition-figure"
  title="Compose from trusted capabilities instead of inventing behavior."
  subtitle="Engineering supplies the real capabilities and constraints. Authored product knowledge contributes intent, relevance, prerequisites, and composition guidance."
  caption="The authored product-knowledge layer did not implement verification, authorization, transaction retrieval, account mutation, or escalation. Those are engineering-built capabilities. The composition layer uses intent, current state, deterministic policy, and available capabilities to shape the surface."
>
  <div class="grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
      <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Current state</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Restricted account; identity verification missing; no active risk review.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
      <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Available capabilities</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Customer profile, account status, transactions, identity verification, restriction action, risk escalation.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
      <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Authored product knowledge</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Purpose: investigate a restricted account. Explain blocked actions through unmet prerequisites.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] p-3.5">
      <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Deterministic policy</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">Restriction removal requires verified identity. Risk escalation remains permitted while restricted. Authorization and mutation stay in application code.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex justify-center py-1">
    <div class="h-5 w-px bg-[var(--border-strong)]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-md border border-[var(--accent-border)] bg-[var(--accent-subtle)] px-4 py-3 text-center">
    <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--accent)]">Context / composition layer</p>
    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-primary)]">Select relevant capabilities, order the task, apply guidance, respect state and policy.</p>
  </div>

  <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex justify-center py-1">
    <div class="h-5 w-px bg-[var(--border-strong)]"></div>
  </div>

  <section class="overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-[var(--border-strong)]" aria-label="Illustrative derived account review surface">
    <header class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] px-4 py-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Derived surface</p>
        <h4 class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Account Review</h4>
      </div>
      <span class="rounded-full border border-[var(--accent-border)] px-2.5 py-1 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--accent)]">Restricted</span>
    </header>

    <ul data-derived-surface-list class="divide-y divide-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-primary)]">
      <li class="flex items-stretch justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-2.5 pl-4 pr-2 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Customer profile</span>
        <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end py-2.5 pl-2 pr-4 text-right text-[11px] text-[var(--text-primary)]">Jordan Rivera</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-stretch justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-2.5 pl-4 pr-2 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Recent transactions</span>
        <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end py-2.5 pl-2 pr-4 text-right text-[11px] text-[var(--text-primary)]">3 entries, 1 blocked transfer</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-stretch justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-2.5 pl-4 pr-2 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Restriction reason</span>
        <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end py-2.5 pl-2 pr-4 text-right text-[11px] text-[var(--text-primary)]">Identity verification required</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-stretch justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-2.5 pl-4 pr-2 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Request verification</span>
        <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end py-2.5 pl-2 pr-4 text-right font-editorial-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)]">Prerequisite for removal</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-stretch justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-2.5 pl-4 pr-2 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Remove restriction</span>
        <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end py-2.5 pl-2 pr-4 text-right font-editorial-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--text-muted)] line-through decoration-[var(--text-muted)]">Blocked: prerequisite unmet</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-stretch justify-between gap-2">
        <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-2.5 pl-4 pr-2 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">Escalate to risk</span>
        <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-end py-2.5 pl-2 pr-4 text-right font-editorial-mono text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)]">Permitted</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] px-4 py-2.5 font-editorial-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">State, authorization, and side effects remain owned by deterministic systems.</p>
  </section>
</ResearchFigureFrame>

<style>
  .composition-figure :global(p),
  .composition-figure :global(h4) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  [data-derived-surface-list] {
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    list-style: none !important;
  }

  [data-derived-surface-list] > li {
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
  }
</style>
